</span></th>
<th id="S1.T1.3.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;"><span id="S1.T1.3.10.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">Individual Attempts</span></th>
